WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:04.100
♪♪

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.667
-Let's get to the news!

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.901
During his remarks at
Saturday's White House

00:00:07.901 --> 00:00:09.801
Correspondents' Dinner,
President Biden said,

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:13.167
"American democracy
is not a reality show."

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:14.200
And he's right.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.934
Reality shows get
much better ratings.

00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:18.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.968
According to a new poll,
President Biden's

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:22.200
approval rating
has increased slightly

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.534
over the last two months,
and now the White House

00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:27.734
is scrambling like hell
to figure out what he did.

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:30.400
"Did he change his hair?
A different mask?

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.167
What tie was he wearing?"

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:34.334
That's right, President Biden's
approval rating

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:36.100
has increased to 42%.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:39.167
He now ranks slightly above
leaf blowers.

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:41.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:43.100
At his rally in Nebraska
yesterday,

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:46.701
former president Trump appeared
to misremember Ohio Republican

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:49.067
Senate candidate
J.D. Vance's name

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:51.100
and called him J.D. Mandel.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:54.534
That's bad enough, but then he
said, "J.D. Mandel will win

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:56.834
or my name isn't Donald Vance."

00:00:56.834 --> 00:00:58.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:02.467
According to a new poll, just
35% of college students said

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:05.968
they like Elon Musk more than
other megabillionaires.

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:09.334
Said Musk, "Oh, yeah?
How much to buy college?"

00:01:09.334 --> 00:01:10.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.901 --> 00:01:13.467
"Not just yours.
The whole idea."

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:15.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:19.901
After the share price of Meta
increased by over 17% last week,

00:01:19.901 --> 00:01:24.968
CEO Mark Zuckerberg became $11
billion wealthier in one day.

00:01:24.968 --> 00:01:28.133
Then that became $12 billion
when he stuck his hand

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:30.667
in the pocket of a hoodie
he hadn't worn in a while.

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:32.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:34.701
"Ooh, that's fortuitous."

00:01:34.701 --> 00:01:36.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.601 --> 00:01:39.801
A couple recently got married on
a Southwest flight to Las Vegas

00:01:39.801 --> 00:01:42.734
and then immediately started
watching different movies.

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:46.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.667 --> 00:01:49.501
It deserved better.
That's a wonderful joke.

00:01:49.501 --> 00:01:52.300
I didn't think it would go well.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.901
But it was too good not to do.

00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:55.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.734 --> 00:01:59.300
A lot of you aren't married yet,
but you're going to be,

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.734
and then one day you're going to
be lying in bed

00:02:01.734 --> 00:02:04.033
and you're going to realize how
[bleep] funny that joke was.

00:02:04.033 --> 00:02:06.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.634
I'm willing -- You know what?

00:02:07.634 --> 00:02:09.334
I'm willing to make
that investment now.

00:02:09.334 --> 00:02:10.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.334 --> 00:02:12.067
Equity. That joke has equity.

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:15.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:16.601
That's right.

00:02:16.601 --> 00:02:19.567
A couple recently got married on
a Southwest flight to Las Vegas,

00:02:19.567 --> 00:02:21.467
and like most couples
who go to Vegas,

00:02:21.467 --> 00:02:23.534
decided to get divorced
on the flight back.

00:02:23.534 --> 00:02:25.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.767 --> 00:02:28.534
According to a new survey,
more than half of Americans want

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:30.767
their family to have access
to their personal phone

00:02:30.767 --> 00:02:32.767
and computer data
after they die.

00:02:32.767 --> 00:02:34.100
The other half are men.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:37.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.667 --> 00:02:41.234
And finally, a single lottery
ticket was sold in Arizona

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:45.767
last week that won the
$473 million Powerball jackpot,

00:02:45.767 --> 00:02:47.234
and the big winner was --

00:02:47.234 --> 00:02:49.400
Aw, damn it!

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.667 --> 00:02:54.267
After Politico
reported on a draft

00:02:54.267 --> 00:02:56.234
of a Supreme Court
majority opinion

00:02:56.234 --> 00:02:57.834
that overturned Roe vs. Wade,

00:02:57.834 --> 00:03:00.200
Republican Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.067
tweeted yesterday that it was

00:03:02.067 --> 00:03:05.167
"The most significant and
glorious news of our lifetime."

00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:08.601
Now, I'm not a legal scholar,
but I do know this --

00:03:08.601 --> 00:03:10.734
if you made that lady happy,

00:03:10.734 --> 00:03:13.934
you did something very bad.

00:03:13.934 --> 00:03:16.100
President Biden
released a statement today

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:17.968
about the leaked
Supreme Court opinion

00:03:17.968 --> 00:03:20.400
and said that if abortion rights
are rolled back,

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.200
voters will have to elect

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.467
more pro-choice officials
in the midterms.

00:03:24.467 --> 00:03:27.567
Okay, you got to stop
putting this on the voters.

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:30.834
You're the president with
control of the House and Senate.

00:03:30.834 --> 00:03:32.934
We did the voting thing.

00:03:32.934 --> 00:03:36.133
That's like me blaming
a bad show on an intern.

00:03:36.133 --> 00:03:38.000
Does it feel good in the moment?

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.968
Yeah!

00:03:39.968 --> 00:03:42.701
It feels great,
but, at the end of the day,

00:03:42.701 --> 00:03:47.601
we all know whose fault it
really is -- Wally's.

00:03:49.868 --> 00:03:51.067
Health officials
announced yesterday

00:03:51.067 --> 00:03:53.300
that the coronavirus infections
in New York City

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:56.400
have reached
a medium-risk threat level,

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.300
which means you have to go from
not wearing a mask

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:01.734
to wearing it below your nose.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.000
According to
unconfirmed reports,

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.234
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:04:06.234 --> 00:04:07.901
is set to
undergo cancer surgery.

00:04:07.901 --> 00:04:10.234
Doctors think that
with their sharpest skills

00:04:10.234 --> 00:04:14.267
and a little luck,
they can remove all the Putin.

00:04:15.601 --> 00:04:16.968
According to a new study,

00:04:16.968 --> 00:04:21.367
a dog's personality has
nothing to do with its breed.

00:04:21.367 --> 00:04:26.367
For example, a different collie
pushed Timmy into the well.

00:04:30.267 --> 00:04:31.701
The series "Grey's Anatomy"

00:04:31.701 --> 00:04:34.501
yesterday celebrated
filming its 400th episode.

00:04:34.501 --> 00:04:36.200
That show has been on so long,

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:39.400
all the doctors
are patients now.

00:04:40.767 --> 00:04:44.033
A house in Dayton, Ohio, that
has been decorated to look like

00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:46.501
Monica's apartment from
the sitcom "Friends"

00:04:46.501 --> 00:04:50.501
is currently up for sale
for $162,000,

00:04:50.501 --> 00:04:53.300
which is also what
the monthly rent would be

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:55.968
for Monica's apartment
in Manhattan.

00:04:57.067 --> 00:04:59.067
And, finally,
the luxury gym Equinox

00:04:59.067 --> 00:05:01.534
will reportedly begin
accepting cryptocurrency

00:05:01.534 --> 00:05:03.267
as a form of
payment this summer,

00:05:03.267 --> 00:05:09.133
while Planet Fitness will begin
accepting Marlboro Miles.

00:05:09.133 --> 00:05:11.667
Vice President Kamala Harris
spoke yesterday

00:05:11.667 --> 00:05:15.267
at a gala for a pro-abortion
rights organization and said,

00:05:15.267 --> 00:05:17.400
"Those Republican leaders

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:20.501
who are trying to weaponize the
use of the law against women,

00:05:20.501 --> 00:05:22.834
well, we say, how dare they."

00:05:22.834 --> 00:05:24.467
Great.
That oughta do it.

00:05:24.467 --> 00:05:25.868
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.868 --> 00:05:28.234
And, if that doesn't stop them,
you can always throw in

00:05:28.234 --> 00:05:29.667
a "Harumph?!"

00:05:29.667 --> 00:05:32.334
[ Laughter ]
Microsoft co-founder Bill Gates

00:05:32.334 --> 00:05:35.033
spoke out yesterday
against the potential reversal

00:05:35.033 --> 00:05:38.067
of the Supreme Court's decision
in Roe v Wade

00:05:38.067 --> 00:05:41.000
and warned that it would
"set us back 50 years."

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.734
He said the next time America
makes that much progress,

00:05:43.734 --> 00:05:45.734
we should remember to hit save.

00:05:45.734 --> 00:05:47.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:47.634 --> 00:05:49.801
In a new interview,
Maryland Governor Larry Hogan

00:05:49.801 --> 00:05:52.434
said that former President Trump
should not run for reelection

00:05:52.434 --> 00:05:55.734
and added that Trump is
"enjoying playing golf

00:05:55.734 --> 00:05:57.167
five or six day as week."

00:05:57.167 --> 00:05:58.334
Why ruin that

00:05:58.334 --> 00:06:00.667
by going back to a job
where he could only play

00:06:00.667 --> 00:06:02.434
four or five days a week?

00:06:02.434 --> 00:06:07.234
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:06:07.234 --> 00:06:10.567
President Biden is set to hold
a Cinco de Mayo party tomorrow

00:06:10.567 --> 00:06:12.634
at the White House,
because what's more fun

00:06:12.634 --> 00:06:14.334
than a Cinco de Mayo
party thrown

00:06:14.334 --> 00:06:15.968
by someone who doesn't drink?

00:06:15.968 --> 00:06:18.367
[ Laughter and applause ]
That's like having
a Halloween party

00:06:18.367 --> 00:06:21.033
and saying, "But FYI,
this is a no-sugar house.

00:06:21.033 --> 00:06:22.400
Who loves raisins?!"

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:23.801 --> 00:06:25.334
NASA is planning on sending

00:06:25.334 --> 00:06:27.534
naked images of humans
into space

00:06:27.534 --> 00:06:28.734
as part of a new mission

00:06:28.734 --> 00:06:30.567
to communicate
with alien civilizations.

00:06:30.567 --> 00:06:32.934
Guys, you can't do that.

00:06:32.934 --> 00:06:35.801
At the very least,
you have to hit them

00:06:35.801 --> 00:06:37.767
with a "U up?" first.

00:06:37.767 --> 00:06:39.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:39.067 --> 00:06:41.501
And, finally,
the NFL announced today

00:06:41.501 --> 00:06:43.634
that the New York Giants
will play a game

00:06:43.634 --> 00:06:46.167
against the Green Bay Packers
this season in London.

00:06:46.167 --> 00:06:48.734
So, instead of losing
27 to nothing,

00:06:48.734 --> 00:06:51.133
the Giants will lose 27-nil.

00:06:51.133 --> 00:06:53.534
[ Laughter ]

00:06:53.534 --> 00:06:56.467
"The New York Times" has
published additional audio

00:06:56.467 --> 00:06:58.467
of House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy

00:06:58.467 --> 00:07:00.667
and the aftermath
of the Capitol attack.

00:07:00.667 --> 00:07:06.100
All right, how do we have this
much audio of Kevin McCarthy?

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:09.567
Pretty soon, we're gonna be able
to put out an E.P..

00:07:09.567 --> 00:07:11.767
[ Laughter ]

00:07:11.767 --> 00:07:14.300
President Biden said yesterday
that his administration

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:17.267
is making progress on reducing
the national debt.

00:07:17.267 --> 00:07:19.801
Oh, good, that was
definitely the thing I was

00:07:19.801 --> 00:07:21.334
most worried about.

00:07:21.334 --> 00:07:22.834
[ Laughter ]
What about abortion,

00:07:22.834 --> 00:07:24.334
the pandemic, climate change?

00:07:24.334 --> 00:07:26.367
The Democrats are like the
people who offer

00:07:26.367 --> 00:07:29.334
to bring the most boring
thing to a party.

00:07:29.334 --> 00:07:32.968
"Good news, everyone, the
napkins are here!"

00:07:32.968 --> 00:07:38.167
[ Laughter ]
"The soiree can begin!"

00:07:38.167 --> 00:07:40.934
President Biden warned yesterday
that the leaked opinion

00:07:40.934 --> 00:07:44.133
that indicated the Supreme Court
is prepared to overturn

00:07:44.133 --> 00:07:47.634
Roe v. Wade could threaten
other freedoms and said,

00:07:47.634 --> 00:07:49.868
"What happens if you have states
change the laws

00:07:49.868 --> 00:07:53.100
saying that children who are
LGBTQ can't be in classrooms

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:54.167
with other children?"

00:07:54.167 --> 00:07:55.701
Said Republicans,
"Oh, hey, that's good.

00:07:55.701 --> 00:07:57.767
That's good."
[ Laughter ]

00:07:57.767 --> 00:07:59.934
"What else you got?"

00:07:59.934 --> 00:08:02.267
Florida Congressman Matt Gaetz
tweeted yesterday...

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:16.467
Which is pretty bold coming
from a guy

00:08:16.467 --> 00:08:19.267
who does all his dating
on Venmo.

00:08:19.267 --> 00:08:22.767
[ Laughter ]

00:08:22.767 --> 00:08:25.968
Several journalists across
multiple news outlets

00:08:25.968 --> 00:08:28.968
have reportedly tested positive
for the coronavirus

00:08:28.968 --> 00:08:30.701
after attending last weekend's

00:08:30.701 --> 00:08:32.267
White House
Correspondents' Dinner.

00:08:32.267 --> 00:08:35.100
So all those articles about how
we're back to normal

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:36.267
are gonna be a week late.

00:08:36.267 --> 00:08:38.834
[ Laughter ]

00:08:38.834 --> 00:08:42.200
Donald Trump Jr. reportedly
met on Tuesday

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.033
with the House Committee
investigating

00:08:44.033 --> 00:08:46.434
the Capitol attack remotely
for more than three hours.

00:08:46.434 --> 00:08:49.434
Three hours doesn't seem
very long,

00:08:49.434 --> 00:08:51.868
but because it's Don Jr.,
it still came out

00:08:51.868 --> 00:08:54.100
to like eight hours' worth
of testimony.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.434
-The media runs right away.

00:08:55.434 --> 00:08:56.868
It's Russian disinformation.

00:08:56.868 --> 00:08:58.267
There's literally zero evidence

00:08:58.267 --> 00:08:59.300
that it's Russian dis--

00:09:00.167 --> 00:09:05.734
[ Laughter ]

00:09:05.734 --> 00:09:08.968
-President Biden mistakenly said
at a White House event this week

00:09:08.968 --> 00:09:11.300
that there's never been
a senator from Delaware.

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.734
While the GOP is trying
to convince us there's

00:09:13.734 --> 00:09:16.167
never been a congressman
from North Carolina.

00:09:16.167 --> 00:09:17.968
[ Laughter ]

00:09:17.968 --> 00:09:20.434
Sunday is Mother's Day,
which means today is

00:09:20.434 --> 00:09:22.067
"I got plenty of time
to get a card."

00:09:22.067 --> 00:09:23.734
Tomorrow is
"I should get a card."

00:09:23.734 --> 00:09:25.534
Saturday is
"What about an e-card?"

00:09:25.534 --> 00:09:27.033
And Sunday is "I'm screwed."

00:09:27.033 --> 00:09:29.267
[ Laughter ]

00:09:29.267 --> 00:09:31.801
Residents of Nantucket voted
yesterday to allow

00:09:31.801 --> 00:09:34.234
everyone to go topless
on its beaches,

00:09:34.234 --> 00:09:36.901
bringing them one step closer
to finally living up

00:09:36.901 --> 00:09:38.667
to their limericks.

00:09:38.667 --> 00:09:42.634
[ Laughter ]

00:09:42.634 --> 00:09:44.133
[ Applause ]

00:09:44.133 --> 00:09:46.934
An otter -- Yeah, sometimes
it takes a minute

00:09:46.934 --> 00:09:53.434
for the limerick jokes to land.

00:09:53.434 --> 00:09:54.901
[ Laughter ]

00:09:54.901 --> 00:09:58.567
We'll be patient.

00:09:58.567 --> 00:10:01.801
An otter was recently spotted
swimming in the Detroit River

00:10:01.801 --> 00:10:03.667
for the first time
in over 100 years.

00:10:03.667 --> 00:10:06.601
But I'm willing to bet
that it's a different otter.

00:10:06.601 --> 00:10:12.267
[ Laughter ]

00:10:12.267 --> 00:10:15.434
And finally, the FDA is looking
at a new proposed rule

00:10:15.434 --> 00:10:16.901
to ban menthol cigarettes.

00:10:16.901 --> 00:10:19.100
Here to talk about it is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:21.400
in a segment called
"Is This Racist?"

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:25.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:25.667 --> 00:10:29.200
-The FDA is going to ban
menthol cigarettes,

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:34.033
and that's ra-- well...

00:10:34.033 --> 00:10:38.067
I mean, it is...

00:10:38.067 --> 00:10:39.467
[ Laughter ]

00:10:39.467 --> 00:10:40.534
Okay. No, wait.

00:10:40.534 --> 00:10:43.367
[ Stammers ]
I mean, it feels ra--

00:10:43.367 --> 00:10:44.968
[ Laughter ]

00:10:44.968 --> 00:10:48.167
But is it, like,
all-the-way racist?

00:10:48.167 --> 00:10:50.501
I -- Okay, okay, okay.

00:10:50.501 --> 00:10:52.934
You gotta look at the -- uh...

00:10:52.934 --> 00:10:55.634
[ Laughter ]

00:10:55.634 --> 00:10:57.701
[ Sighs ] Yeah,
'cause if I say that,

00:10:57.701 --> 00:10:59.501
then that means
the other thing, so,

00:10:59.501 --> 00:11:02.234
dicey, dicey, dicey.

00:11:02.234 --> 00:11:03.901
Uh...Okay. Wait.

00:11:03.901 --> 00:11:05.100
I got it.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.501
It is racist, because
the other cigarettes

00:11:07.501 --> 00:11:08.868
are, well -- that's different.

00:11:08.868 --> 00:11:11.868
[ Laughter ]

00:11:11.868 --> 00:11:13.367
Okay. Wait.

00:11:13.367 --> 00:11:14.367
Okay.

00:11:14.367 --> 00:11:15.734
Yeah, okay, wait, no.

00:11:15.734 --> 00:11:18.300
Not racist, final answer.

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.200
♪♪

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:21.834 --> 00:11:23.634
-Amber Ruffin, everybody!

00:11:23.634 --> 00:11:25.334
-Wait! No, I mean --

00:11:25.334 --> 00:11:30.467
♪♪

